{"articleNo":"429220","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=429220&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [충남도립대학교] 2023년 청양군 퐁당청양 사회적경제 창업프로젝트 창업경진대회 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.04.06","hit":"2509","attachments":[{"name":"2023년 청양군 창업경진대회 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=429220&attachNo=122881"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">대회목적</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:50.3pt;text-indent:-50.3pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">❍ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">충남 사회적경제 혁신타운 및 청양군 사회적경제를 선도하고 지역과 상생하는 사회적가치를 실현할 수 있는 창업주체 발굴 및 육성</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">대회 운영방식</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">공모분야</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -28pt; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">참가 희망자는 사회적경제에서 지역과 상생하는 사회적가치를 실현할 수 있는 분야로 자율적으로 선정하여 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">지원자격</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">❍ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">지원자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">사회적기업 예비창업자 또는 사회적경제기업 창업 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년 미만인 자로써 아래 </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">①</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">②</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">③ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -123.9pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">참가 조건을 모두 충족하는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">①</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">단순 사업아이템 제시가 아닌</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><u style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">연도 내 청양군에서 실제 법인화</span></u><u style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span></u><u style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">협동조합</span></u><u style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span></u><u style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">및 창업가능하고 지원금 정산이 가능한 팀</span></u><u style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span></u><u style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">필수</span></u><u style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">② </span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">공고일 기준 </span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">전국 만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">18</span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">세</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">~45</span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">세</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">공고일 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">인 자로 팀원중 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -98pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">명 이상 충족하는 팀</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">③ </span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(3</span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">명 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">으로 지원하여야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">개인지원 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3. 대회일정&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- 공모접수: 4.10.(월) ~ 5.12.(금)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- 예선: 5월중</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -52.4pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- 본선: 6월중</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:6.0pt;color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※ 붙임 참조</span><br></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0